flowchart TD
  A[Staff receives checkout request] --> B{Borrower eligible?}
  B -- No --> C[Explain eligibility policy]
  B -- Yes --> D{Asset available?}
  D -- No --> E[Suggest another asset]
  D -- Yes --> F[Record asset, borrower, and due date]
